      "source_summary": {
        "content": "I found a strong candidate on LinkedIn for our Senior Data Scientist role (job ID #DS2024) and have their resume PDF. Please create their profile in our ATS, assess their fit against the job description, and if suitable, move them through the interview process, then after a positive interview outcome, route their offer for approval and start the background check.",
