        "content": "I cannot add interview feedback at this time because it requires future input that we don't have yet; we'll need to collect it after the interview is conducted. Could you please confirm that Alex Johnson's interview outcome was positive? If so, share the offer details like salary and start date for routing approvals, and provide their consent documentation to start the background check.",
